  {
    "id": "p-3cb65b",
    "offset": 12,
    "text": "*Answers to § 1.* AN1"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-270732",
    "offset": 35,
    "text": "1. \"All\" *Sign of Quantity.* \"persons represented by the Name 'I'\" (or \"I's\") *Subject.* \"are\" *Copula.* \"persons who have been out for a walk\" *Predicate.*"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-192bbc",
    "offset": 193,
    "text": "or, more briefly,"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b5a9b9",
    "offset": 212,
    "text": "\"All | 'I's | are | persons who have been out for a walk\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a6f809",
    "offset": 272,
    "text": "2. \"All | 'I's | are | persons who feel better\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-97c2af",
    "offset": 322,
    "text": "3. \"No | persons who are not 'John' | are | persons who have read the letter\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-75e920",
    "offset": 402,
    "text": "4. \"No | Members of the Class 'you and I' | are | old persons\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-471135",
    "offset": 467,
    "text": "5. \"No | fat creatures | are | creatures that run well\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-2d620d",
    "offset": 525,
    "text": "6. \"No | not-brave persons | are | persons deserving of the fair\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a89982",
    "offset": 593,
    "text": "7. \"No | not-pale persons | are | persons who look poetical\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-9716ec",
    "offset": 656,
    "text": "8. \"Some | judges | are | persons who lose their tempers\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-593b7e",
    "offset": 716,
    "text": "9. \"All | 'I's | are | persons who do not neglect important business\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-0296c4",
    "offset": 788,
    "text": "10. \"All | difficult things | are | things that need attention\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-073316",
    "offset": 854,
    "text": "11. \"All | unwholesome things | are | things that should be avoided\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-712b5b",
    "offset": 925,
    "text": "12. \"All | laws passed last week | are | laws relating to excise\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b1130b",
    "offset": 993,
    "text": "13. \"All | logical studies | are | things that puzzle me\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-56b79a",
    "offset": 1053,
    "text": "14. \"No | persons in the house | are | Jews\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-eef4d8",
    "offset": 1100,
    "text": "15. \"Some | not well-cooked dishes | are | unwholesome dishes\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-4af254",
    "offset": 1165,
    "text": "16. \"All | unexciting books | are | books that make one drowsy\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-16fdad",
    "offset": 1231,
    "text": "17. \"All | men who know what they're about | are | men who can detect a sharper\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-3f1464",
    "offset": 1314,
    "text": "18. \"All | Members of the Class 'you and I' | are | persons who know what they're about\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-39f39f",
    "offset": 1405,
    "text": "19. \"Some | bald persons | are | persons accustomed to wear wigs\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-de0f8e",
    "offset": 1473,
    "text": "20. \"All | fully occupied persons | are | persons who do not talk about their grievances\"."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-cda92f",
    "offset": 1565,
    "text": "21. \"No | riddles that can be solved | are | riddles that interest me\"."
  },
  {
