    "id": "p-11a2ef",
    "offset": 7520,
    "text": "*Answers to § 5.* AN5"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-700fd5",
    "offset": 7543,
    "text": "1. Somebody who has been out for a walk is feeling better."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-478142",
    "offset": 7603,
    "text": "2. No one but John knows what the letter is about."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-912ad7",
    "offset": 7655,
    "text": "3. You and I like walking."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-9c19f0",
    "offset": 7683,
    "text": "4. Honesty is sometimes the best policy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a5434d",
    "offset": 7725,
    "text": "5. Some greyhounds are not fat."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-1e17d5",
    "offset": 7758,
    "text": "6. Some brave persons get their deserts."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-e5c6a7",
    "offset": 7800,
    "text": "7. Some rich persons are not Esquimaux."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-4452cd",
    "offset": 7841,
    "text": "8. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-95378b",
    "offset": 7910,
    "text": "9. John is ill."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-f0cd82",
    "offset": 7927,
    "text": "10. Some things, that are not umbrellas, should be left behind on a journey."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-0b69a0",
    "offset": 8005,
    "text": "11. No music is worth paying for, unless it causes vibration in the air."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-1dbf74",
    "offset": 8079,
    "text": "12. Some holidays are tiresome."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-ad22ec",
    "offset": 8112,
    "text": "13. Englishmen are not Frenchmen."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-14fbfc",
    "offset": 8147,
    "text": "14. No photograph of a lady is satisfactory."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-44fa37",
    "offset": 8193,
    "text": "15. No one looks poetical unless he is phlegmatic."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-468153",
    "offset": 8245,
    "text": "16. Some thin persons are not cheerful."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-acaa46",
    "offset": 8286,
    "text": "17. Some judges do not exercise self-control."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b40de0",
    "offset": 8333,
    "text": "18. Pigs are not fed on barley-water."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-554d04",
    "offset": 8372,
    "text": "19. Some black rabbits are not old. pg129 20. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-87e66e",
    "offset": 8484,
    "text": "21. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-8ab016",
    "offset": 8551,
    "text": "22. Some lessons need attention."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-acbc11",
    "offset": 8585,
    "text": "23. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-ff0fee",
    "offset": 8652,
    "text": "24. No one, who forgets a promise, fails to do mischief."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-6ae6c7",
    "offset": 8710,
    "text": "25. Some greedy creatures cannot fly."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-3eeadc",
    "offset": 8749,
    "text": "26. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-f6c69c",
    "offset": 8819,
    "text": "27. No bride-cakes are things that need not be avoided."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-66b825",
    "offset": 8876,
    "text": "28. John is happy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-abea00",
    "offset": 8896,
    "text": "29. Some people, who are not gamblers, are not philosophers."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-32bba2",
    "offset": 8958,
    "text": "30. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-e9a07b",
    "offset": 9028,
    "text": "31. None of my lodgers write poetry."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-9af98d",
    "offset": 9066,
    "text": "32. Senna is not nice."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-42310c",
    "offset": 9090,
    "text": "33. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-068e4e",
    "offset": 9160,
    "text": "34. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-0def66",
    "offset": 9227,
    "text": "35. Logic is unintelligible."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-98163b",
    "offset": 9257,
    "text": "36. Some wild creatures are fat."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-fcba08",
    "offset": 9291,
    "text": "37. All wasps are unwelcome."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-517371",
    "offset": 9321,
    "text": "38. All black rabbits are young."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a2d6de",
    "offset": 9355,
    "text": "39. Some hard-boiled things can be cracked."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-8b604e",
    "offset": 9400,
    "text": "40. No antelopes fail to delight the eye."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b216c7",
    "offset": 9443,
    "text": "41. All well-fed canaries are cheerful."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-643795",
    "offset": 9484,
    "text": "42. Some poetry is not producible at will."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-afb23e",
    "offset": 9528,
    "text": "43. No country infested by dragons fails to be fascinating."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-ede8a8",
    "offset": 9589,
    "text": "44. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-eeacb7",
    "offset": 9656,
    "text": "45. Some picturesque things are not made of sugar."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-f84f99",
    "offset": 9708,
    "text": "46. No children can sit still."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-187716",
    "offset": 9740,
    "text": "47. Some cats cannot whistle."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-ac03fb",
    "offset": 9771,
    "text": "48. You are terrible."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-6efee5",
    "offset": 9794,
    "text": "49. Some oysters are not amusing."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-bba9f5",
    "offset": 9829,
    "text": "50. Nobody in the house has a beard a yard long."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-c665d2",
    "offset": 9879,
    "text": "51. Some ill-fed canaries are unhappy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-0a4898",
    "offset": 9919,
    "text": "52. My sisters cannot sing."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a0d5a3",
    "offset": 9948,
    "text": "53. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-f01716",
    "offset": 10018,
    "text": "54. Some rich things are nice."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-6e355a",
    "offset": 10050,
    "text": "55. My cousins are none of them judges, and judges are none of them cousins of mine."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-662455",
    "offset": 10136,
    "text": "56. Something wearisome is not eagerly wished for."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-fccc49",
    "offset": 10188,
    "text": "57. Senna is nasty."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a0027d",
    "offset": 10209,
    "text": "58. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-d4491b",
    "offset": 10279,
    "text": "59. Niggers are not any of them tall."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a4947f",
    "offset": 10318,
    "text": "60. Some obstinate persons are not philosophers."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-3a1293",
    "offset": 10368,
    "text": "61. John is happy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-894342",
    "offset": 10388,
    "text": "62. Some unwholesome dishes are not present here (i.e. cannot be spoken of as \"these\")."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b63058",
    "offset": 10477,
    "text": "63. No books suit feverish patients unless they make one drowsy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-37470f",
    "offset": 10543,
    "text": "64. Some greedy creatures cannot fly."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-f416d1",
    "offset": 10582,
    "text": "65. You and I can detect a sharper."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-476f62",
    "offset": 10619,
    "text": "66. Some dreams are not lambs. pg130 67. No lizard needs a hairbrush."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-fd8663",
    "offset": 10690,
    "text": "68. Some things, that may escape notice, are not battles."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-bb0740",
    "offset": 10749,
    "text": "69. My cousins are not any of them judges."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-75fbe8",
    "offset": 10793,
    "text": "70. Some hard-boiled things can be cracked."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a2fe94",
    "offset": 10838,
    "text": "71. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-e647dd",
    "offset": 10908,
    "text": "72. She is unpopular."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-9b2128",
    "offset": 10931,
    "text": "73. Some people, who wear wigs, are not children of yours."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-67751a",
    "offset": 10991,
    "text": "74. No lobsters expect impossibilities."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b353c0",
    "offset": 11032,
    "text": "75. No nightmare is eagerly desired."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-baf01c",
    "offset": 11070,
    "text": "76. Some nice things are not plumcakes."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-c4c95d",
    "offset": 11111,
    "text": "77. Some kinds of jam need not be shunned."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-3a68ef",
    "offset": 11155,
    "text": "78. All ducks are ungraceful."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-94ec6b",
    "offset": 11186,
    "text": "79. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-fc760d",
    "offset": 11253,
    "text": "80. No man, who begs in the street, should fail to keep accounts."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-a47d0b",
    "offset": 11320,
    "text": "81. Some savage creatures are not spiders."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-694b5c",
    "offset": 11364,
    "text": "82. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-31e685",
    "offset": 11434,
    "text": "83. No travelers, who do not carry plenty of small change, fail to lose their luggage."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-705128",
    "offset": 11522,
    "text": "84. [No Concl. Fallacy of Unlike Eliminands with an Entity-Premiss.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b492a3",
    "offset": 11592,
    "text": "85. Judges are none of them cousins of mine."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-b38e13",
    "offset": 11638,
    "text": "86. All my lodgers are sane."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-d6bd03",
    "offset": 11668,
    "text": "87. Those who are busy are contented, and discontented people are not busy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-c1f9cc",
    "offset": 11745,
    "text": "88. None of my cousins are judges."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-4a2c48",
    "offset": 11781,
    "text": "89. No nightingale dislikes sugar."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-44748b",
    "offset": 11817,
    "text": "90. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-0c9f8b",
    "offset": 11884,
    "text": "91. Some excuses are not clear explanations."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-13cbcc",
    "offset": 11930,
    "text": "92. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-9ff353",
    "offset": 11997,
    "text": "93. No kind deed need cause scruple."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-2f945c",
    "offset": 12035,
    "text": "94. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-d82b58",
    "offset": 12102,
    "text": "95. [No Concl. Fallacy of Like Eliminands not asserted to exist.]"
  },
  {
    "id": "p-c68997",
    "offset": 12169,
    "text": "96. No cheats are trustworthy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-36f942",
    "offset": 12201,
    "text": "97. No clever child of mine is greedy."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-dbeb0f",
    "offset": 12241,
    "text": "98. Some things, that are meant to amuse, are not Acts of Parliament."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-72798c",
    "offset": 12312,
    "text": "99. No tour, that is ever forgotten, is worth writing a book about."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-8fdc9c",
    "offset": 12381,
    "text": "100. No obedient child of mine is contented."
  },
  {
    "id": "p-8a641b",
    "offset": 12427,
    "text": "101. Your visit does not annoy me."
  },
  {
