    "id": "p-27a942",
    "offset": 15697,
    "text": "39. Concl. incomplete: the omitted portion is \"Sugar is not salt.\""
  },
  {
    "id": "p-49d4f5",
    "offset": 15765,
    "text": "40. Concl. right."
  },
  {
